---
import '~/styles/siph-widgets.css';
---

<figure class="siph-widget cpo-sheet">
  <div class="siph-widget__accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="siph-widget__head">
    <p class="siph-widget__kicker">示意图</p>
    <p class="siph-widget__title">激光器放在封装外</p>
  </div>
  <fieldset class="cpo-choice">
    <legend class="cpo-sr">激光器放在哪里</legend>
    <label>
      前面板 ELS
      <input type="radio" name="cpo-els" value="front" checked />
    </label>
    <label>
      留在封装里
      <input type="radio" name="cpo-els" value="inside" />
    </label>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="siph-widget__stage">
    <div class="cpo-panel" data-panel="front">
      <div class="cpo-stage-pad">
        <div class="cpo-face">
          <p class="cpo-kicker">前面板 · 可热插拔</p>
          <div class="cpo-die is-on">
            <b>ELS</b>
            <small>外置激光器，持续发光</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cpo-fiber">
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          <span>保偏光纤，把光送进 PIC</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cpo-pkg">
          <p class="cpo-kicker">封装内结温 85–105 °C</p>
          <div class="cpo-dies">
            <div class="cpo-die">
              <b>ASIC</b>
              <small>交换或 GPU 的热</small>
            </div>
            <div class="cpo-die">
              <b>PIC</b>
              <small>只受光，激光不在这里</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cpo-note">激光离开热点。坏了可以在面板上换，不必拆封装。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cpo-panel" data-panel="inside">
      <div class="cpo-stage-pad">
        <div class="cpo-face">
          <p class="cpo-kicker">前面板</p>
          <div class="cpo-die is-ghost">
            <b>空位</b>
            <small>激光没有放在面板上</small>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cpo-pkg">
          <p class="cpo-kicker">封装内结温 85–105 °C</p>
          <div class="cpo-dies">
            <div class="cpo-die">
              <b>ASIC</b>
              <small>热点</small>
            </div>
            <div class="cpo-die">
              <b>PIC</b>
              <small>调制在这里</small>
            </div>
            <div class="cpo-die is-on">
              <b>激光器</b>
              <small>和热点在同一只封装里</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="cpo-note">激光器怕热，寿命也有限。片上集成这一条，行业后来普遍放下了。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="siph-legend">
    <li><i class="swatch-heat"></i>封装里的热，85–105 °C</li>
    <li><i class="swatch-te"></i>激光器所在的位置</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="siph-widget__credit">Fierceman · fierceman26.github.io</p>
  <figcaption>
    结温按笔记里的 85–105 °C。外置光源（ELS）放在前面板，经保偏光纤给 PIC 送光，并且可以热插拔。左边这一档是已经普遍放弃的片上激光，用来对照热点为什么留不住它。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
